          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഒന്നുകൂടി (onnukūṭi) is native Dravidian: onnŭ, \"one\" (DEDR 990), with kūṭi, \"joined, also\", from the verb \"to come together\" (DEDR 1882, with Tamil kūṭu)."
