              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അർത്ഥം (arthaṁ) — \"meaning\". ഇതിന്റെ അർത്ഥം എന്താണ്? — \"what is the meaning of this?\", with എന്താണ്, \"what is\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അർത്ഥം (arthaṁ) from Sanskrit artha, \"aim, thing, meaning\", taken over whole as a tatsama, with Malayalam's noun ending -ṁ (CDIAL 638)."
            }
          ]
        },
